      "raw_text": "[4:40PM] #Apongbon #EkoBridge #TrafficUpdate \n\nIt will interest you to know that traffic from Broad street linking Apongbon underneath the bridge is good, then as you move towards the Market it gets a bit slow due to market activities.\n\nAs you move inwards the Eko Bridge inwards Costain is good. \n\nOur Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is smooth for you.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
      "cleaned_text": "[4:40PM] #Apongbon #EkoBridge #TrafficUpdate It will interest you to know that traffic from Broad street linking Apongbon underneath the bridge is good, then as you move towards the Market it gets a bit slow due to market activities. As you move inwards the Eko Bridge inwards Costain is good. Our Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is smooth for you.",
      "english_translation": "[4:40PM] #Apongbon #EkoBridge #TrafficUpdate It will interest you to know that traffic from Broad street linking Apongbon underneath the bridge is good, then as you move towards the Market it gets a bit slow due to market activities. As you move inwards the Eko Bridge inwards Costain is good. Our Men are strategically positioned to ensure traffic is smooth for you.",
